ed.","'hover' is assigned a value but never used.","'setHover' is assigned a value but never used.","'my_love' is defined but never used.","'kamala' is defined but never used.","'index' is assigned a value but never used.","'setIndex' is assigned a value but never used.","'carouselPple' is assigned a value but never used.","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","'Linkedn' is assigned a value but never used.","'forHireContact' is defined but never used.","'showModal' is assigned a value but never used.",{"desc":"312","fix":"313"},{"desc":"314","fix":"315"},{"desc":"316","fix":"317"},{"desc":"318","fix":"319"},{"desc":"320","fix":"321"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [props.location.search]",{"range":"322","text":"323"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [verify]",{"range":"324","text":"325"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [talentId]",{"range":"326","text":"327"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [fetchTalents]",{"range":"328","text":"329"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [setShow]",{"range":"330","text":"331"},[1163,1165],"[props.location.search]",[667,669],"[verify]",[2033,2035],"[talentId]",[1007,1009],"[fetchTalents]",[2560,2562],"[setShow]"]